# Riverglades for the Horde, part 2 of 4 (2026-11-12). Hand-written from players'
# recordings of the zone and Forever's quest data for titles, levels, objectives and places.
# Order: Tran'gul's first errand in Sunnyglade (the Twilight cult's farm town) with Fuzzle's escort, and back;
# Clubtoe's quests in Sunnyglade and Chogg'Zac, and back to Tran'gul for Land of Giants; Na'zok's camp and the
# ogres of Bolder'ok in the hills to the north-east (levels 36-42), with Jom-jom's escort on the way back to the
# ogres' chieftain.
# Offered only after another quest is handed in (players' recordings): Tran'gul's quests after Show Them How It's
# Done (part 1); Digging for Answers after Twilight Missives; Biting the Hand's escort after the finger bones;
# The Purple Ones and Sickening Lights after Digging for Answers; the second Purple Ones after the first; Twilight
# No More! after the second Purple Ones; Spread the Word after Twilight No More!; Land of Giants after Spread the
# Word and Tran'gul's and Clubtoe's quests; Might Makes Right and Unworthy Champion after Land of Giants (every
# recorded character, 17 of 17); Clugfist's Decree and Bloodmaster's Ring after Might Makes Right; each bout of the
# Bloodmaster's Ring after the one before, the last two after Gobam's errands.
# The Bloodmaster's Ring bouts are one-on-one fights against elite ogres and beasts (41-45): an optional side chain
# for players who want it. Recorded players of levels 41-43 won them (one lost a bout and took it again).
# Elites: Scoutmaster Vargas (42), behind a group choice. Chogg'Zac (41) is Land of Giants' way to Bolder'ok: by
# then a few levels under you, and recorded players of 42-43 killed him alone.
# Left out on purpose:
# - Step One: Rock (95183): Hamur offers it only once Might Makes Right is handed in, when the rock piles are back
#   in the hills behind you; Step Two: More Rock (96026) asks for ten Heavy Weightstones, a blacksmith's make.
# - Our Ogre Friend (94733), A Boar's Delight (94734) and A Treat for a Friend (94737): offered only after the fourth
#   bout of the Ring, and the sweetberries grow by the Eastsea pirates far to the south-east.

step Tran'gul
  tip Tran'gul stands beside Krom'rosh in the middle of Rog'mar: now that the Farholde camp has had its lesson, he has work in Sunnyglade.
  accept 94672                          -- Encroaching Twilight
  accept 94680                          -- Twilight Missives

step Fuzzle
  tip West of Rog'mar the Twilight cult holds the farm town of Sunnyglade. Fuzzle, a kobold who wants out, hides in the middle of the town.
  accept 94961                          -- Biting the Hand

step Sunnyglade
  tip The cultists fill the streets and fields; the Shadowmancers on the town's northern side carry the missives. The finger bones drop from all of them.
  tip Careful: Chogg'Zac, an elite ogre (level 41), walks the western streets of Sunnyglade, around 44-47,47-52. Pull the cultists out towards you and let him pass.
  kill 256952 x8 quest 94672.1          -- Twilight Raider
  kill 254560 x8 quest 94672.2          -- Twilight Shadowmancer
  kill 256798 x8 quest 94672.3          -- Twilight Neophyte
  collect 265745 x3 quest 94680.1       -- Twilight Missive
  collect 267073 x20 quest 94961.1      -- Twilight Finger Bone

step Fuzzle
  tip Fuzzle wants out of Sunnyglade: lead him west to his treasure at the edge of town and keep the cultists off him.
  turnin 94961
  accept 94963                          -- Biting the Hand
  complete 94963 @41.6,47.7             -- lead Fuzzle out of Sunnyglade to his treasure, west of the town
  turnin 94963                          -- Fuzzle's Treasure

step Tran'gul
  tip East back to Rog'mar.
  turnin 94672
  turnin 94680
  accept 94727                          -- Digging for Answers: for Clubtoe in Sunnyglade

step Clubtoe
  tip West to Sunnyglade again: Clubtoe, a Twilight miner who wants out, waits at the town's eastern edge. Talk him round, then hand Tran'gul's quest in; one of the missing ogres stands a few steps west.
  complete 94727 @49.9,46.9             -- talk Clubtoe round
  turnin 94727
  accept 95417                          -- The Purple Ones
  accept 95602                          -- Sickening Lights
  turnin 95417                          -- Twilight Brute, a few steps west
  accept 95601                          -- The Purple Ones

step The ritual grounds
  tip The ritualists and their empowered brutes gather at the ritual circles in the middle of Sunnyglade: wreck five of the circles.
  tip Careful: Chogg'Zac, the elite ogre (level 41), walks through here from the western streets: watch for him before each pull.
  kill 261711 x5 quest 95601.1          -- Empowered Brute
  kill 262169 x10 quest 95601.2         -- Twilight Ritualist
  complete 95602 @47.7,49.9             -- destroy 5 Twilight Ritual Circles

step Clubtoe
  turnin 95601
  turnin 95602
  accept 95427                          -- Twilight No More!

step Chogg'Zac
  tip Careful: Chogg'Zac, the two-headed ogre at the western edge of Sunnyglade, is an elite (level 41): grouping up is advised under 43. Clear the cultists around him first and come in with full health and mana: recorded players of 42-43 killed him alone. Clugfist's quests in Bolder'ok wait on this one: skip him and Land of Giants, the Bolder'ok quests and Da'grosh's camp in the west go with him (about 21,000 XP); the guide then leaves them out.
  collect 265750 quest 95427.2 optional @44.9,51.0  -- Chogg's Head
  collect 265751 quest 95427.1 optional @44.9,51.0  -- Zac's Head

step Clubtoe
  when complete 95427
  turnin 95427
  accept 95418                          -- Spread the Word: for Tran'gul in Rog'mar

step Tran'gul
  when onquest 95418
  tip East back to Rog'mar: Clubtoe's word goes to Tran'gul, and Tran'gul's to Clugfist, the ogres' chieftain.
  turnin 95418
  accept 95420                          -- Land of Giants: for Clugfist in Bolder'ok

